# "Return to Desktop".
#  1) Quiesce screen-capture (drain the writeback + un-tap the CWB + CDM off)
#     while gamescope is still live, so nothing is orphaned. The recorder stays
#     alive (paused), so one clip continues into ES once capture resumes.
#  2) SIGKILL gamescope/Steam immediately -- do NOT let them exit cleanly. A clean
#     atomic-disable saves the DSI PLL/PHY state which sway then restores; after a
#     capture session that saved state is stale and the panel re-init times out
#     (-110 -> black screen). An immediate SIGKILL skips the save, so sway's
#     enable does a full PLL re-lock from scratch and the panel comes back clean.
/usr/bin/rocknix-screenrecord pause 2>/dev/null

killall -9 gamescope steam FEX 2>/dev/null
